    <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 5: Wet Steam Mixture &amp; Two-Phase Thermodynamics</p>
    <p bold="true">Properties of two-phase liquid-vapor mixture at P = 2 MPa and specified vapor quality Q = 0.75</p>
    <p bold="true">calculated directly via fundamental thermodynamic relations: M = M_liq + Q * (M_vap - M_liq).</p>
    </content>
  </text>
