  <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
    <content>
    <p bold="true">Section 7: Industrial Case Study — Rankine Cycle Steam Turbine Expansion</p>
    <p bold="true">High-pressure turbine expansion from 8 MPa, 520 °C down to condenser vacuum (8 kPa) with eta_turb = 88%.</p>
    <p bold="true">Includes Mollier (h-s) Diagram visualization with the steam expansion trajectory.</p>
    </content>
  </text>
  </region>
  <region left="18" top="8347" width="60" height="24" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
  <math>
    <description active="true" position="Top" lang="eng">
      <content>
        <p>High-pressure turbine inlet: P_turb_in = 8.0 MPa (80.0 bar)</p>
      </content>
    </description>
    <input>
    <e type="operand">P_turb_in</e>
    <e type="operand">8000000</e>
